sequenceDiagram
    participant PlatformOp as Platform Operator<br/>(rhods-operator)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant TrainerOp as Trainer Operator<br/>(odh-trainer-operator)
    participant KFController as Kubeflow Trainer<br/>Controller Manager
    participant Webhook as Validating Webhook<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS
    participant User as Data Scientist<br/>(kubectl / API)
    participant JobSetCtrl as JobSet Controller

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over PlatformOp,KFController: Flow 1: Trainer CR Reconciliation
        PlatformOp->>K8sAPI: Create Trainer CR (default-trainer)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: Watch notification
        TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Check JobSet Operator health<br/>(OLM check + CRD + CR conditions)
        K8sAPI-->>TrainerOp: Dependency status
        alt Dependencies healthy
            TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Apply kustomize manifests<br/>(Server-side apply)<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
            Note over TrainerOp: Deploys: Controller, Webhooks,<br/>CRDs, ClusterTrainingRuntimes,<br/>ImageStreams, RBAC, PodMonitor
            K8sAPI-->>KFController: Controller pods started
            TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status<br/>Conditions: Ready, ProvisioningSucceeded
        else Dependencies unhealthy
            TrainerOp->>K8sAPI: Update Trainer CR status<br/>Condition: Degraded<br/>Requeue after 60s
        end
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 230)
        Note over User,JobSetCtrl: Flow 2: TrainJob Submission
        User->>K8sAPI: Create TrainJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer token / client cert
        K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate TrainJob<br/>POST /validate-trainer-kubeflow-org-v1alpha1-trainjob<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS TLS (self-signed)
        Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admission response (allow/deny)
        K8sAPI-->>KFController: Watch notification (TrainJob created)
        KFController->>K8sAPI: Resolve ClusterTrainingRuntime<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>KFController: Runtime template
        KFController->>K8sAPI: Create JobSet CR<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
        K8sAPI-->>JobSetCtrl: Watch notification (JobSet created)
        JobSetCtrl->>K8sAPI: Create Jobs + Pods<br/>Auth: ServiceAccount token
    end
